# Build output and dependencies.
dist
node_modules
coverage
playwright-report
test-results

# Generated content. These are written by the nightly jobs with their own
# JSON.stringify formatting, and a bot commit landing while the hook reformats
# them is a fight nobody needs. The season calendar is hand-edited between
# seasons, but the nightly job writes it at every rollover - same fight, same
# rule.
src/content/vinyl.json
src/content/comics.json
src/content/fortnite.json
src/content/fortnite-seasons.json

# CMS-authored content. Sveltia writes these collections through the GitHub
# API, where no pre-commit hook runs, and it preserves exactly what was typed
# (a trailing space on a phone once turned CI red). Same reasoning as the JSON
# above: content is data, the build validates it, and a format check adds no
# safety - only red builds.
src/content/blog/*.md
src/content/shows/*.md
src/content/now/*.md

# Auto-generated, and the repo's own rule is never to hand-edit it.
CHANGELOG.md
package-lock.json
